# CryptoResearch: track the application source, tests, templates and project
# documentation only. This folder is also the live workspace, so it holds
# private research records, holdings, provider responses, logs and backups:
# those never go into Git.
#
# Allowlist: everything at the top level is ignored unless re-included below,
# so a new private file or folder is never picked up by accident.

/*

# Git configuration
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes

# GitHub Actions: CI and the backlog PR workflow (no secrets, no records)
!/.github/

# Application source, tests and test fixtures (fictional data only)
!/dashboard/
!/package.json
# Render's start command (node server.js) for the hosted desk
!/server.js
!/Open Dashboard.cmd
!/Open Demo Dashboard.cmd

# Prompt templates, rubrics and JSON schemas the application reads
!/templates/

# SQL migrations of the optional Research Explorer (Supabase); schema only,
# never data or keys
!/supabase/

# Project documentation
!/README.md
!/WORKSPACE-MAP.md
!/COWORK-INSTRUCTIONS.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/DESK_STATE.md
# The overnight run's log (2026-10-29, claude/overnight-hardening)
!/OVERNIGHT_LOG.md
!/CONVERSATIONS.md
# Engineering design notes the engineering lane writes (design tasks, public
# repository: no records, holdings, credentials or client details)
!/docs/
/docs/*
!/docs/engineering/
# The retired lane's backlog, frozen (PR-B 5b, 2026-10-28)
!/docs/history/
# The architectural constitution (Eric, 2026-10-27)
!/docs/CONSTITUTION.md
# The desk on one sheet (CONSTITUTION Part 4, question 2)
!/docs/ONE-SHEET.md

# Claude Code sub-agents and commands for the pilot (never settings,
# launch configs or worktrees)
!/.claude/
/.claude/*
!/.claude/agents/
!/.claude/commands/

# Audit reports (inspected); their evidence, screenshots, workspace copies,
# record mirrors, probe outputs and code copies stay local
!/audits/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated or fictional data inside the application folder

/dashboard/index/
/dashboard/demo-workspace/
node_modules/

# Owner's own research prompts (project-specific, personal context)
/templates/source-prompts/*
!/templates/source-prompts/README.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
